    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "one row per completed request, then one summary row"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Raw Output Example",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "check_name,status,e2e_ms,ttft_ms,tpot_ms,end_to_end_request_latency_p50_msec,ttft_p50_msec,time_per_output_token_tpot_p50_msec,inter_token_latency_itl_p50_msec,request_throughput_requests_sec\nreq_0,ok,400,40,12,380,35,11,10,4.5\nsummary,ok,380,35,11,380,35,11,10,4.5"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "run_benchmark Command Plus Options for Smoke Run",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "bash run_benchmark.sh --smoke --validate --dtype bfloat16 --input-len 64 --output-len 16 --max-total-tokens 2048 --max-concurrency 2 --request-rate inf --num-prompts 2 --seed 42"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "run_benchmark Command Plus Options for Baseline Run",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "bash run_benchmark.sh --baseline --validate --dtype bfloat16 --input-len 128 --output-len 840 --max-total-tokens 16384 --max-concurrency 8 --request-rate inf --num-prompts 24 --seed 42"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "run_benchmark Command Plus Options for Extended Run",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "bash run_benchmark.sh --extended --validate --dtype bfloat16 --input-len 128 --output-len 1700 --max-total-tokens 32768 --max-concurrency 8 --request-rate inf --num-prompts 48 --seed 42"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Output Fields / Metrics to Parse",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "end_to_end_request_latency_p50_msec, ttft_p50_msec, time_per_output_token_tpot_p50_msec, inter_token_latency_itl_p50_msec, request_throughput_requests_sec"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Success Criteria",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "The client exits 0 and at least one request completes"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Parser and Normalization Notes",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Parse the serving CSV, not server logs. When the response streams, ttft_ms is the time to the first token and tpot_ms is (e2e - ttft) / (output tokens - 1). A non-streaming response leaves ttft_ms blank. p50, p95, and p99 are percentiles of the completed requests. The summary row copies the p50 into e2e_ms, ttft_ms, and tpot_ms"
  },
